percentage.description:
Percentage of requests to mirror (0..=100). 0 mirrors nothing;
100 mirrors every request. The sampling is per-request (a
random draw against this percentage).

selector.description:
Key components: `ip`, `credential`, and/or `route` (at least one;
order does not matter). `credential` falls back to the client IP
until authentication (DW-019) identifies consumers.

embedding_dim.description:
The dimension of the embedding vectors. Must match what the
embedding service returns for the configured model;
validation rejects 0.

Service.description:
The logical API being exposed: base path, version, default policies;
targets exactly one upstream, or a weighted split of upstreams
since DW-040 (canary / blue-green).

cookie.description:
The cookie name the gateway reads and sets. Must be a valid
cookie-name token (RFC 6265: the RFC 2616 `token` grammar);
validation rejects anything else.
